; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Triangle Twist
; CATEGORY: Spirals & Curves
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     spiral, triangle, angles, color fade
; SUMMARY:  Turns a little more than 120 degrees at each corner so a growing triangle twists into a vortex.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   A triangle turns 120 degrees at each corner. This program turns
;   122 instead, and makes every side a little longer. The extra 2
;   degrees add up, so the triangles slowly rotate as they grow and
;   form a twisting vortex. The color fades from deep purple to
;   bright orange along the way.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Try other angles in the last line: 118, 121, 125, 61.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * a small change in angle makes a big change in the picture
;   * mixing two colors little by little with arithmetic
;   * a procedure with three inputs to explore with
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Use 118: does it twist the other way?
;   * Use 92 for a twisting square, or 74 for a twisting pentagon.
;   * Swap the two colors so it fades from orange to purple.
; ============================================================

; Mix purple [90 30 140] into orange [250 150 30]. :t goes from 0 to 1.
to fade :t
  output (list 90 + 160 * :t 30 + 120 * :t 140 - 110 * :t)
end

to twist :angle :steps :grow
  repeat :steps [
    setpencolor fade repcount / :steps
    forward :grow * repcount
    right :angle
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [20 15 30]
setpensize 2
twist 122 140 3.3
